     A* WORKERS' COMP NOTIFICATIONS DETAIL FILE                       *
     A*****************************************************************
     A*                                                               *
     A*  PROJECT:  WC2277       PROGRAMMER:  C:65                     *
     A*  CREATED:  04/10/14                                           *
     A*  DESCRIPTION:  THIS FILE HOLDS THE RECORDS FOR INCLUDING THE  *
     A*                NECESSARY DOCUMENTS TO ATTACH TO A NOTIFICATION*
     A*                EMAIL.  EACH RECORD IN THIS FILE IS KEYED BY   *
     A*                TYPE TO A RECORD IN THE MASTER FILE. THE KEY   *
     A*                FIELD ALLOWS FOR MULTIPLE DOCUMENTS PER        *
     A*                NOTIFICATION TYPE.                             *
     A*                                                               *
     A*****************************************************************
     A* REVISIONS:                                                    *
     A*                                                               *
     A*                                                               *
     A*                                                               *
     A*****************************************************************
     A                                      REF(WREFP)
     A          R PND01                     TEXT('NOTIFICATIONS FILE')
     A            NDCO#     R     S         REFFLD(CO#)
     A            NDFND     R     S         REFFLD(FND)
     A            NDEMP#    R     S         REFFLD(EMP#)
     A            NDDIV     R     S         REFFLD(DIV)
     A            NDFYR     R     S         REFFLD(FYR)
     A            NDCASE    R     S         REFFLD(CASE)
     A            NDTYPE    R               REFFLD(DS20)
     A                                      COLHDG('TYPE OF NOTIFICATION')
     A            NDKEY     R               REFFLD(DS20)
     A                                      COLHDG('DOCUMENT KEY')
     A            NDFOLD    R               REFFLD(FLDR)
     A                                      COLHDG('DOCUMENT FOLDER')
     A            NDDCID    R               REFFLD(DCID)
     A                                      COLHDG('DOCUMENT NAME')
     A            NDUNCN       255A
     A                                      COLHDG('FULL UNC PATH')
     A            NDUSER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('USER')
     A            NDPGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('PROGRAM')
     A            NDTIME    R     S         REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('TIME')
     A            NDDT      R     S         REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('DATE')
     A            NDIUSR    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('INITIAL' 'USER')
     A            NDIPGM    R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('INITIAL' 'PROGRAM')
     A            NDITIM    R     S         REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('INITIAL' 'TIME')
     A            NDIDT     R     S         REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('INITIAL' 'DATE')
     A            NDSEQ#    R     S         REFFLD(SEQ#)
     A                                      COLHDG('DARTS REMARK' 'SEQ#')
